&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain high-quality standards:&lt;/strong&gt; Write scalable, accessible, and responsive front-end code that meets our clients&#39; expectations as well as our engineering best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive client retention:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to the team, client, and overall company&#39;s success by providing exceptional customer relations and ensuring clients feel supported and heard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Triage and problem-solve:&lt;/strong&gt; Utilize critical thinking to accurately assess the severity of incoming tickets, prioritize workloads, and ensure our clients&#39; needs are met with the proper technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advance product UX:&lt;/strong&gt; Improve the growth, adoption, and stability of &lt;a href=&quot;http://ElasticPress.io&quot;&gt;ElasticPress.io&lt;/a&gt; and SiteWatch by ensuring a flawless front-end experience for our users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About you:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are an effective communicator.&lt;/strong&gt; You excel at explaining technical front-end concepts in client-friendly terms, possess strong empathy for user issues, and thrive in written client interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
