&lt;li&gt;AI-Enabled Solution Design: Combine client context with Invisible’s AI toolkit to architect solutions using classical automation, GenAI, and human-in-the-loop approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous Improvement: Document playbooks, mentor new analysts/PMs, and feed insights back into Invisible’s product and sales teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
