&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Social Growth Manager who sees social for what it really is: the fastest distribution engine in the market. Not a broadcasting function. Not a content calendar exercise. A growth lever.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own social media across both products, turning a library of existing content into a pipeline, creating new ones, running creative campaigns that actually land, and making sure everything happening in the field and community shows up loud on social media.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
