&lt;h4&gt;About the role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join one of several teams building the low-level systems behind CAST AI&#39;s multi-cloud automation platform. The work sits at the intersection of Kubernetes, cloud infrastructure, and Linux.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on your strengths, you&#39;ll work in one of these areas:&lt;/p&gt;
